      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "data is not giving the full context, lets say we want to survey who \nwill win the t20 world cup in Bangladesh. then most of the fans\nwill say Bangladesh will win the t20 world cup. \n\nThis is poor representation of data it may not reflect the actual \naccuracte prediciton.\nThis is callled sample noise \n\nSampling bias: we didnt did proper sampling ; lets say we asked all the\ncountries parcipating in world cup , but again we asked only Bangladesh\ncitizen they being fan will say th",
      "fontSize": 84,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "data is not giving the full context, lets say we want to survey who \nwill win the t20 world cup in Bangladesh. then most of the fans\nwill say Bangladesh will win the t20 world cup. \n\nThis is poor representation of data it may not reflect the actual \naccuracte prediciton.\nThis is callled sample noise \n\nSampling bias: we didnt did proper sampling ; lets say we asked all the\ncountries parcipating in world cup , but again we asked only Bangladesh\ncitizen they being fan will say th",
